fN1c\" alt=\"BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（網上截圖）\"><figcaption>BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（網上截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230815/768156855439593472703492.jpeg/pWKfBkdQ8kAeZBzDcuU0UxMbI5lywPr6r5O1ra-Tta0\" alt=\"BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（IG@calvinklein）\"><figcaption>BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（IG@calvinklein）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230815/768156858161827840978152.jpeg/aS2Cdbw_UX2r9EeFDO2sSIU5M0jzs_LJkUMxuZFDMbk\" alt=\"BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（IG@calvinklein）\"><figcaption>BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（IG@calvinklein）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230815/768156852671221760021367.jpeg/RfbAPD1LW903seXZu2opYOZzuFBTCmedlQQ7zZUEO80\" alt=\"BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（IG@calvinklein）\"><figcaption>BTS防彈少年團成員田柾國（IG@calvinklein）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251205/1073608165486235648346270.jpeg/6re9mEiJneFk-CU7a790JIW-JV6jH6WtsvYY97L2GPc\" alt=\"aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）\"><figcaption>aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251205/1073608165725310976874512.jpeg/P83c2SNeUVONeIkawesDeTmWPqt1uHwa6pNzmuqTc5o\" alt=\"aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）\"><figcaption>aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251205/1073608160792547328053714.jpeg/6ZxeCJcv0Llkq4xaOzhnr9_I9YBs8jFR3AoVktwKFZI\" alt=\"aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）\"><figcaption>aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251205/1073608163011465216307685.jpeg/8FihJPKK1Og_OrqYKpxvYuIEEqd7AtkLN2bHWzdmx1s\" alt=\"aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）\"><figcaption>aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250813/1032345974971830272693128.jpeg/IjxtdvtcMY_-efOWKb6pni2Ot7XKnlBj2pNsjdqTbI0\" alt=\"aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）\"><figcaption>aespa成員Winter（IG@imwinter）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>2026演唱會資訊》GD、BTS、aespa、BABYMONSTER！台灣演唱會時間總整理</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-13T13:41:50.147281+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1640,"images":29,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}